From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 20:03:46 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 131/155] [ae-patch] Link each number in the merged pull
 request row and give each opened line a caret

The folded row under a chat message showed its pull request numbers as plain
text, and the opened list's lines did not look like they opened. Each number
is now a link to its pull request, opening in a new tab like the line's
open-external icon, with the same preview card the chat's inline pull request
links show on hover and focus. The fold's toggle no longer wraps the row: it
holds the caret, icon and count, and its ::after covers the row, so a click
anywhere but a number still opens the fold while the numbers sit above it as
links of their own. Each opened line now starts with the header's caret
(Tabler chevron-right, turned down while that line's card is open).
